# Creates a verzoek object in the Objects API through the mTLS gateway. Run it with the "mtls" environment
# (http-client.private.env.json), which presents the sandbox client certificate.
#
# The Objects API notifies Open Notificaties (kanaal "objecten"), which calls Valtimo back. The Verzoek plugin then
# fetches the verzoek, creates an Example case, creates a zaak in Open Zaak with the BSN as initiator, and starts the
# "example-process". Valtimo reaches the Objects API, the Objecttypen API, Open Zaak and Open Notificaties only through
# the mTLS gateway.
#
# The objecttype URL is the address the Objects API knows the Objecttypen API by: the gateway, at https://localhost:8447.
@objects_api_url = https://127.0.0.1:8443/api/v2/objects
@token = 182c13e2209161852c53cef53a879f7a2f923430
@objecttype_url = https://localhost:8447/api/v2/objecttypes/a6f2e8b1-6c3d-4f7e-9b2a-1d5c8e0f3a74
@objecttype_version = 1

### Create verzoek
POST {{objects_api_url}}
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Content-Crs: EPSG:4326
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "type": "{{objecttype_url}}",
    "record": {
        "typeVersion": {{objecttype_version}},
        "data": {
            "type": "example",
            "bsn": "999991322",
            "data": {
                "name": "Celeste Avion {{$random.alphanumeric(4)}}"
            },
            "language_code": "nl",
            "submission_id": "",
            "public_reference": "OF-{{$random.alphanumeric(8)}}"
        },
        "startAt": "2026-01-01"
    }
}
